  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than three years from the date of this decision.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended by Section 51 of the Planning and Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications:  PP/02A, PP/03A Received: 02 June 2025, PP/01A Received: 07 May 2025.  \r\n\r\nReason: In order to ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission.  ",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building, unless otherwise shown on the approved plans.  \r\n\r\nReason: In order to safeguard the appearance of the area.  \r\n",
    "Condition : 4 - The existing detached single storey rear garage outbuilding and its single storey side extension hereby permitted shall be used for purposes incidental to the enjoyment of the house only at 'No. 3 The Ridgeway, W3 8LW' as described at the top of this decision notice and for no other purpose (for example, it may not be used as a self-contained dwelling or contain a bedroom, bathroom, kitchen or other primary residential accommodation, nor may it be used for business purposes).  \r\n\r\nReason: In order to protect neighbours' living conditions and the character of the area.  "
